      "writtenOn": "2025-07-10T17:30:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For consistency, all `gpio_set_level` and `gpio_get_level` calls need to be changed, and similarly, other APIs, like `hook`, `sleep`, `timer` also require modification. This driver would better be moved under `zephyr/` to fully adapt the Zephyr conversion, similar to the `cbi_flash` driver. As we also introduced the `ap_pwrseq` subsystem to Zephyr, and adapting this subsystem would be more appropriate. As a result, it seems not a small effort and will likely be a follow-up task.",
